{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're driving away on a forest road, late at night, under a heavy storm. Your car breaks down. Luckily, there might be a gas station nearby. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But a misfortune never comes alone. The storm has brought something else, something otherworldly that oddly smells of spilled diesel oil. When it rains, it pours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AUTO-CRISIS</strong> is a <strong>short horror game (~60mn)\u00a0</strong>about cars, rain, being lost, and bad days.   <br><br><u>WHAT TO EXPECT ?</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short psychological horror game (around 60 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unreliable player character with a mystery to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric game, at night, under the rain (best played with a headset!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal trip about trauma, carcentrism and survivor's guilt</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>WHAT <strong><i>NOT</i></strong> TO EXPECT ?</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cheap jumpscares and loud saturated noises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No key to doors and random puzzles to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No narrative that holds your hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a driving game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304580/extras/88dc99d24f26ab72fb8314d3be377271.poster.avif?t=1771938147\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304580/extras/88dc99d24f26ab72fb8314d3be377271.webm?t=1771938147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304580/extras/88dc99d24f26ab72fb8314d3be377271.mp4?t=1771938147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">IMMERSIVE SHORT HORROR EXPERIENCE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic environments in a surreal setting. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are soaked wet, and can barely see. The thunder strikes in the distance, revealing otherworldly creatures in the storm's vanishing light... </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rain has brought something else. You are not alone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304580/extras/7242443f8d3fabf29f989a6b131b8756.poster.avif?t=1771938147\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304580/extras/7242443f8d3fabf29f989a6b131b8756.webm?t=1771938147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304580/extras/7242443f8d3fabf29f989a6b131b8756.mp4?t=1771938147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">OTHERWORLDLY DANGERS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are creatures that can be only seen when the storm strikes. Remember where they are to avoid them.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A writhing, radiant orb of light is passing through. Look away from its draining warmth.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest is full of crawling nightmares. You can hear them, but can you see them in time ?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A giant absurd manifestation is towering over the trees, Start running now and you might make it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304580/extras/ab7f0f1b300092b9e1440d3a53714bef.poster.avif?t=1771938147\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304580/extras/ab7f0f1b300092b9e1440d3a53714bef.webm?t=1771938147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304580/extras/ab7f0f1b300092b9e1440d3a53714bef.mp4?t=1771938147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">HIGH QUALITY ENVIRONMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a short psychological experience packed with high fidelity graphics and optimized worlds made available by Unreal Engine 5. Go through a rural ruined parking, a subterrean surreal backroom, a boggy pine forest, a dump, a tribal village, and a continuous, endless skybridge at night, away from everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Into the wild","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304580/76465f3102c866adc5fbdc1fa989eff8e7c468a2.jpg"},{"name":"Vehicular me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304580/7e234ca7eecb67112a7039f9ddf56708f5ef32c6.jpg"},{"name":"Infinite moment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304580/255d06dea8990776edcfb1f54f978d26aa819220.jpg"},{"name":"So many ways it's not my fault","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304580/6f9407d3f34d2a43151c43a75adf63c494ad12d9.jpg"},{"name":"Too far to walk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304580/207070d6d5e8ece08d14a533e6ac18dd04a27062.jpg"},{"name":"There are only roads","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304580/53a0af6d0ff9319a0856b893e5ffffb8634f34f6.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3304580?t=1771938147","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3304580?t=1771938147","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304580/1de372af3cd9560af842f78c9b8dcf95d38402b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771938147","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304580/1de372af3cd9560af842f78c9b8dcf95d38402b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771938147","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game has a realistic atmosphere may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work. It has what can be assimilated to jumpscares, blood, violence and some gore."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're driving away on a forest road, late at night, under a heavy storm. Your car breaks down. Luckily, there might be a gas station nearby. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But a misfortune never comes alone. The storm has brought something else, something otherworldly that oddly smells of spilled diesel oil. When it rains, it pours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AUTO-CRISIS</strong> is a <strong>short horror game (~60mn)\u00a0</strong>about cars, rain, being lost, and bad days.   <br><br><u>WHAT TO EXPECT ?</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p clas